Use ODRL vocabulary with namespace "https://example.org/data-transfers#".
Use prefix eval with namespace "https://eyereasoner.github.io/eyemind/odrl#".
Use prefix ex with namespace "https://example.org/data-transfers#".
Use prefix odrl with namespace "http://www.w3.org/ns/odrl/2/".

evaluation is an evaluationReport.
evaluation has policy groupPolicy.
evaluation has conflictStrategy prohibit.
payroll is a request.
payroll has assignee hrCompany.
payroll has action odrl:distribute.
payroll has target employeeData.
payroll has subject employees.
payroll has state payrollState.
pensions is a request.
pensions has assignee hrCompany.
pensions has action odrl:distribute.
pensions has target employeeData.
pensions has subject employees.
pensions has state pensionsState.
support is a request.
support has assignee hrCompany.
support has action odrl:distribute.
support has target employeeData.
support has subject employees.
support has state supportState.
analytics is a request.
analytics has assignee hrCompany.
analytics has action odrl:distribute.
analytics has target employeeData.
analytics has subject employees.
analytics has state analyticsState.
analytics has fulfilledDuty assessment.
helpdesk is a request.
helpdesk has assignee hrCompany.
helpdesk has action odrl:distribute.
helpdesk has target employeeData.
helpdesk has subject employees.
helpdesk has state helpdeskState.
relocation is a request.
relocation has assignee hrCompany.
relocation has action odrl:distribute.
relocation has target employeeData.
relocation has subject employees.
relocation has state relocationState.
archive is a request.
archive has assignee hrCompany.
archive has action odrl:distribute.
archive has target employeeData.
archive has subject employees.
archive has state archiveState.
evaluation has validationStatus valid.
analytics has unmetConstraint adequate.
helpdesk has unmetConstraint adequate.
relocation has unmetConstraint adequate.
archive has unmetConstraint adequate.
payroll has unmetConstraint clauses.
pensions has unmetConstraint clauses.
support has unmetConstraint clauses.
relocation has unmetConstraint clauses.
archive has unmetConstraint clauses.
payroll has unmetConstraint health.
pensions has unmetConstraint health.
support has unmetConstraint health.
helpdesk has unmetConstraint health.
relocation has unmetConstraint health.
archive has unmetConstraint health.
payroll has unmetConstraint derogation.
pensions has unmetConstraint derogation.
support has unmetConstraint derogation.
analytics has unmetConstraint derogation.
helpdesk has unmetConstraint derogation.
archive has unmetConstraint derogation.
payroll has applicablePermission onAdequacy.
pensions has applicablePermission onAdequacy.
support has applicablePermission onAdequacy.
analytics has applicablePermission onClauses.
relocation has applicablePermission onConsent.
analytics has applicableProhibition noHealthData.
helpdesk has uncertainty witness(rule 349, "Issue", ex:helpdesk, ex:assessment, ex:onClauses, eval:MissingDutyEvidence).
witness(rule 349, "Issue", ex:helpdesk, ex:assessment, ex:onClauses, eval:MissingDutyEvidence) is an uncertainty.
witness(rule 349, "Issue", ex:helpdesk, ex:assessment, ex:onClauses, eval:MissingDutyEvidence) has reportDuty assessment.
witness(rule 349, "Issue", ex:helpdesk, ex:assessment, ex:onClauses, eval:MissingDutyEvidence) has rule onClauses.
witness(rule 349, "Issue", ex:helpdesk, ex:assessment, ex:onClauses, eval:MissingDutyEvidence) has reason eval:MissingDutyEvidence.
evaluation has conflict witness(rule 351, "Conflict", ex:evaluation, ex:analytics, ex:groupPolicy, ex:onClauses, ex:groupPolicy, ex:noHealthData).
witness(rule 351, "Conflict", ex:evaluation, ex:analytics, ex:groupPolicy, ex:onClauses, ex:groupPolicy, ex:noHealthData) is a conflict.
witness(rule 351, "Conflict", ex:evaluation, ex:analytics, ex:groupPolicy, ex:onClauses, ex:groupPolicy, ex:noHealthData) has request analytics.
witness(rule 351, "Conflict", ex:evaluation, ex:analytics, ex:groupPolicy, ex:onClauses, ex:groupPolicy, ex:noHealthData) has permissionPolicy groupPolicy.
witness(rule 351, "Conflict", ex:evaluation, ex:analytics, ex:groupPolicy, ex:onClauses, ex:groupPolicy, ex:noHealthData) has permissionRule onClauses.
witness(rule 351, "Conflict", ex:evaluation, ex:analytics, ex:groupPolicy, ex:onClauses, ex:groupPolicy, ex:noHealthData) has prohibitionPolicy groupPolicy.
witness(rule 351, "Conflict", ex:evaluation, ex:analytics, ex:groupPolicy, ex:onClauses, ex:groupPolicy, ex:noHealthData) has prohibitionRule noHealthData.
evaluation has conflictCount 1.
evaluation has request helpdesk.
helpdesk has decision undetermined.
evaluation has request payroll.
payroll has decision allowed.
evaluation has request pensions.
pensions has decision allowed.
evaluation has request support.
support has decision allowed.
evaluation has request relocation.
relocation has decision allowed.
evaluation has request analytics.
analytics has decision prohibited.
evaluation has request archive.
archive has decision notApplicable.
evaluation has canHappen payroll.
evaluation has canHappen pensions.
evaluation has canHappen support.
evaluation has canHappen relocation.
